        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the EU member states where we market our Products and operate, we are currently subject to, inter alia, the Medical Device Regulation (\"MDR\") as implemented into national legislation by the EU member states, and as amended from time to time, as well as local applicable law.",
