        "accession_number": "0001645113-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on the results of our preclinical and clinical research, we have developed a pipeline strategy to advance TTFields therapy through Phase 2 and Phase 3 studies across multiple solid tumor types where TTFields has shown efficacy, including GBM, NSCLC, brain metastases from NSCLC and pancreatic cancer.",
        "start_character": 25410,
        "end_character": 25716
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645113-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645113-26-000017-4537e667441f71e5",
        "accession_number": "0001645113-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Presently, the traditional biotechnology, pharmaceutical and medical technology industries expend significant resources in developing novel and proprietary therapies for the treatment of solid tumors, including GBM, NSCLC, pancreatic cancer, MPM and other indications that we are currently investigating.",
        "start_character": 43177,
        "end_character": 43481
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645113-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645113-26-000017-4537e667441f71e5",
        "accession_number": "0001645113-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are aware of a few third parties in the United States and China developing devices and filing for intellectual property protection related to TTFields therapy.",
        "start_character": 42483,
        "end_character": 42645
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645113-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645113-26-000017-4537e667441f71e5",
        "accession_number": "0001645113-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are subject to unannounced inspections by the FDA to determine our compliance with the QSR and other regulations and these inspections include the manufacturing facilities of our subcontractors.",
